# head/adult/man/square: the man's Square head: a flat crown, the jaw straight down to square corners, a 10 px chin
# P2b FACES (wave 2). Every head type keeps A3's eye rows and columns, the nose pixel and the mouth row
# (STYLE_P2 4), so expressions, marks and paint fit them all. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role head square
layer head
anchor head
keys rest

view D key rest origin -1 -3
mark face 2 5
